// PostScript grammar — PARG source (parsanol grammar language).
//
// Issue: claricle/postscript#4. Compiles via the parsanol PARG
// toolchain to the artifact the native engine registers:
//
//   parsanol parg compile grammars/postscript.parg -o grammars/postscript.json
//
// Skeleton below marks the sections the real grammar must cover
// (extracted from lib/postscript/source/{lexer,ast_builder}.rb):

// program := { ws | comment | literal | operator }
// comment := "%" [^\n]*
// literal := number | string | hex_string | name | array | procedure | dictionary
// operator := <keyword per Model::Operators registry>
